@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@tenantToken = replace-with-tenant-login-token
@reviewerToken = replace-with-owner-or-agency-admin-token
@organizationId = replace-with-organization-id
@propertyId = replace-with-property-id
@listingId = replace-with-published-listing-id
@applicationId = replace-with-created-application-id
@notificationId = replace-with-notification-id
@applicationVersion = 0
@listingVersion = 1
@profileVersion = 0
@moveInDate = 2030-01-01

### Complete a private self-reported profile using the tenant token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/tenant-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"legalName":"Your name","phone":"+254711111111","countryCode":"KE","city":"Nairobi","employmentStatus":"EMPLOYED"}

### Read the profile and current profileVersion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/tenant-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Edit private profile; submitted applications retain their earlier snapshot
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/tenant-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{profileVersion}},"details":{"legalName":"Your updated name","phone":"+254711111111","countryCode":"KE","city":"Nairobi","employmentStatus":"SELF_EMPLOYED"}}

### Read current public terms plus listingVersion; replace listingVersion above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/application-listings/{{listingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Create a private draft; choose your intended future moveInDate
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"listingId":"{{listingId}}","listingVersion":{{listingVersion}},"details":{"householdSize":2,"requestedMoveInDate":"{{moveInDate}}","message":"I am interested in this rental."}}

### Own application list and dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Own counts across all statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Reload before every mutation and update applicationVersion above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Edit a DRAFT or INFORMATION_REQUESTED application
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"details":{"householdSize":3,"requestedMoveInDate":"{{moveInDate}}","message":"Updated household details."}}

### Submit or resubmit reviewed details/profile with explicit disclosure consent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{applicationId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"profileVersion":{{profileVersion}},"listingVersion":{{listingVersion}},"consentToShare":true}

### Reviewer queue; drafts that were never submitted remain hidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications?status=SUBMITTED
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}

### Reviewer dashboard counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}

### Reviewer detail and current application version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}

### Start review from SUBMITTED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}}}

### Append a private reviewer note; this does not increment applicationVersion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"text":"Internal review observations."}

### Read private notes as an authorized reviewer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}

### Request additional information; this message is shared with the applicant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/request-information
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"message":"Please review and update your household details."}

### If listing terms changed, review preview and refresh while the application is editable
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{applicationId}}/refresh-listing
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"listingVersion":{{listingVersion}}}

### Approve only from UNDER_REVIEW; atomically reserves the available unit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"message":"Approved pending lease preparation."}

### Alternative reviewer decision: reject with a shared reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"message":"We are unable to proceed with this application."}

### Cancel an APPROVED application and release only its tracked reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/organizations/{{organizationId}}/properties/{{propertyId}}/applications/{{applicationId}}/cancel-approval
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}},"message":"Approval cancelled before lease creation."}

### Applicant withdrawal also releases an APPROVED reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{applicationId}}/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":{{applicationVersion}}}

### Shared application history contains no private reviewer notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/applications/{{applicationId}}/history?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Tenant notifications and unread count
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications?unreadOnly=true&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Unread summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}

### Mark an owned notification read; repeat calls preserve its first read time
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantToken}}
